2. Scrim: polyester staple yarn<br />
3. Width: ≤2.2m<br />
4. Thickness: 1.7mm<br />
5. Weight: 400-600g/m2 ±10%<br />
6. Brand Name: PHILITE</p>
<h2>3. Features of Anti-spark Polyester Needle Felt:</h2>
<p>1. Anti-spark<br />
2. Good anti-acid, good anti-alkali, good hydrolysis stability<br />
3. Excellent anti-abrasion<br />
