					<description><![CDATA[Polypropylene needle felt filter cloth is one of the most commonly used materials for making liquid filter bags. Polypropylene needle felt is a specific type commonly used in industrial filtration applications.  It is a non-woven fabric made by mechanically needling polypropylene fibers, which has good filtration performance and durability. This type of needle felt is mainly used for the filtration and separation of solid particles, liquids or gases. Its production process is similar to the general needle felting production, but the material of choice is polypropylene fiber.
<ul>
 	<li><strong>Material</strong>: Non Woven Polypropylene Fabric.</li>
 	<li><strong>Thickness</strong>: 2.0-3.8mm.</li>
 	<li><strong>Filtration accuracy</strong>: 0.2/1/5/10/25/50/100/150/200/300um.</li>
 	<li><strong>Color</strong>: White.</li>
 	<li><strong>Usage</strong>: Liquid Filter.</li>
 	<li><strong>Type</strong>: Non-woven Filter.</li>
 	<li><strong>Diameter &#38; Length</strong>: Accept customization.</li>
 	<li><strong>Capacity</strong>: Capable of manufacturing standard PP needle felt 15,000 m²/day.</li>
</ul>

<hr />

Learn More About <strong><a href="http://filter.philitee.com/?product=polypropylene-filter-bags">Polypropylene Filter Bags</a></strong>]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[		<div data-elementor-type="product-post" data-elementor-id="3274" class="elementor elementor-3274" data-elementor-post-type="product">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a176024 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="a176024" data-element_type="container">
