				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p>The fiber is thin         The surface area is large       The filtration coefficient is large        The adsorption effect is better</p><h3><strong><b>Applications</b></strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Air Filtration</strong></li></ul><p>Polypropylene needle felt is widely used in air filtration, such as air conditioning systems, clean rooms, ventilation systems, etc. It can effectively remove dust, smoke, pollen and other particulate matter in the air and improve air quality.</p><ul><li><strong>Liquid Filtration</strong></li></ul><p>Polypropylene needle felt is widely used in liquid filtration, such as water treatment, chemical production, food and beverage production and other fields. It can effectively remove suspended matter, microorganisms, bacteria, etc. in the liquid to ensure the purity of the liquid.</p><ul><li><strong>Dust Collection</strong></li></ul><p>In many industrial production processes, a large amount of dust will be generated, such as mining, metallurgy, wood processing, etc. It can effectively collect these dusts to prevent them from causing harm to the environment and the environment.</p><ul><li><strong>Noise Control</strong></li></ul><p>It has good sound absorption and can be used in noise control fields, such as automotive interiors, building sound insulation, etc.</p><ul><li><strong>Medical Field</strong></li></ul><p>It is also widely used in the medical field, such as medical masks, protective clothing, etc. It can effectively block the spread of viruses and bacteria and protect the safety of medical staff and patients.</p><ul><li><strong>Agricultural Field</strong></li></ul><p>It can also be used in the agricultural field, such as soil improvement, plant protection, etc. It can effectively prevent the occurrence of pests and diseases and improve the yield and quality of crops.</p>						</div>
