		<title>PPS Needle Felt Filter Cloth</title>
		<link>https://filter.philitee.com/?product=pps-needle-felt-filter-cloth</link>
					<comments>https://filter.philitee.com/?product=pps-needle-felt-filter-cloth#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[wpdc@20248]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 25 Nov 2024 14:15:53 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">http://filter.philitee.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=3240</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[PPS (polyphenylene sulfide or Rayton) needle felt is a high-performance filter material, mainly used in applications that require resistance to high temperatures and corrosive chemicals. PPS is a special synthetic polymer that can maintain stability under high temperature and chemical corrosion conditions, so it is often used in industrial flue gas purification and high-temperature gas filtration.
<ul>
 	<li><strong>High Temperature Resistance.</strong></li>
 	<li><strong>Chemical Stability.</strong></li>
 	<li><strong>Low Hygroscopicity.</strong></li>
 	<li><strong>Abrasion Resistance.</strong></li>
 	<li><strong>Good Mechanical Strength.</strong></li>
</ul>

<hr />

Learn more about <strong><a href="http://filter.philitee.com/?product=pps-filter-bags">PPS(Rayton) Filter Bags</a></strong>]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[		<div data-elementor-type="product-post" data-elementor-id="3240" class="elementor elementor-3240" data-elementor-post-type="product">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-72f8226 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="72f8226" data-element_type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6e63d70 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="6e63d70" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<h3>Main Features of PPS Needle Felt Filter Cloth</h3><ul><li><strong>High Temperature Resistance</strong>: PPS has excellent high temperature resistance and is able to work in high temperature environments, usually up to temperatures above 190°C (374°F).</li><li><strong>Chemical Stability</strong>: PPS material shows strong stability to a variety of chemical corrosive substances, so it is suitable for some filtering environments with corrosive gases or chemical substances.</li><li><strong>Low Hygroscopicity</strong>: PPS material has very low hygroscopicity and can maintain stable performance in humid environments.</li><li><strong>Abrasion Resistance</strong>: PPS needle-punched filter felt is relatively wear-resistant and suitable for industrial filtration environments that require long-term use.</li><li><strong>Good Mechanical Strength</strong>: PPS material has good mechanical strength to a certain extent, and can withstand certain tension and pressure during the filtration process.</li></ul><hr /><h3>Types of PPS (Rayton) Fabrics</h3><ul><li><strong>PPS Filament</strong>: Thickness 2.2-0.3mm; Weight 1150-200g.</li><li><strong>PPS Short Fiber</strong>: Thickness 2.2-0.3mm; Weight 1150-200g.</li><li><strong>PPS Monofilament</strong>: Thickness 0.8-0.15mm; Weight 550g-80g.</li></ul><hr /><h4><strong><b>Physical and Chemical Properties of PPS (Rayton) Needle Felt: (Customization is accepted in terms of feature and size)</b></strong></h4><table><tbody><tr><td width="144">Air permeability(L/m2.s)</td><td colspan="2" width="203">200-300</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" width="144">Tensile strength(N/5 cm)</td><td width="203">warp</td><td width="102">≥1100</td></tr><tr><td width="203">weft</td><td width="102">≥1500</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" width="144">Tensile  elongation(%)</td><td width="203">warp</td><td width="102">≤15</td></tr><tr><td width="203">weft</td><td width="102">≤20</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" width="144">Heat shrinkage(%)</td><td width="203">warp</td><td width="102">≤1.5</td></tr><tr><td width="203">weft</td><td width="102">≤1.0</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" width="144">Temperature(°C/°F)</td><td width="203">Continue</td><td width="102">190/374</td></tr><tr><td width="203">Instant</td><td width="102">220/428</td></tr><tr><td width="144">Anti-acid</td><td colspan="2" width="203">Good</td></tr><tr><td width="144">Anti-alkali</td><td colspan="2" width="203">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td width="144">Anti-abrasion</td><td colspan="2" width="203">Excellent</td></tr><tr><td width="144">Hydrolysis stability</td><td colspan="2" width="203">Middle</td></tr></tbody></table><div><h3>Application of PPS Needle Felt Filter Cloth</h3></div><div><p>PPS needle felt filter cloth is often used in high-temperature flue gas purification equipment, coal power plants, cement plants, oil refineries, metallurgical industries and other fields that require gas filtration and particle separation in high-temperature and corrosive environments. Due to its special properties, it can effectively capture tiny particles and pollutants, ensuring a clean and safe production environment.</p></div>						</div>
